      {
        "id": 115011,
        "name": "phantaskippy",
        "username": "phantaskippy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-08-16T16:02:56.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>One important thing to note on \"re-assigned\" attacks is that you cannot add dice to it with attack+1 tokens, nor will it trigger using an attack-1 token. &nbsp;You also can't use aim to affect it. &nbsp;Those exact dice will be reassigned, you can't affect them otherwise.</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:47:03.948Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 0,
        "reads": 0,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 0.0,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 10989,
        "topic_slug": "tachyon-card-help",
        "display_username": "phantaskippy",
        "primary_group_name": "playtesters",
        "flair_name": "playtesters",
        "flair_url": "/uploads/default/original/1X/f46928191dbf93b4d0df24571543f49779579225.png",
        "flair_bg_color": "",
        "flair_color": "",
        "flair_group_id": 41,
        "badges_granted": [],
        "version": 1,
        "can_edit": false,
        "can_delete": false,
        "can_recover": false,
        "can_see_hidden_post": false,
        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": true,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>One important thing to note on &quot;re-assigned&quot; attacks is that you cannot add dice to it with attack+1 tokens, nor will it trigger using an attack-1 token. &nbsp;You also can&#39;t use aim to affect it. &nbsp;Those exact dice will be reassigned, you can&#39;t affect them otherwise.</p>",
        "actions_summary": [],
        "moderator": false,
