        "raw": "[quote=\"phantaskippy\"]\n\nOne important thing to note on &quot;re-assigned&quot; attacks is that you cannot add dice to it with attack+1 tokens, nor will it trigger using an attack-1 token. &nbsp;You also can&#39;t use aim to affect it. &nbsp;Those exact dice will be reassigned, you can&#39;t affect them otherwise.\n\n[/quote]\n\nThere&#39;s no doubt in my mind that you are correct, as you are a Playtester and I&#39;m sure needed to have these discussions, so is this spelled out somewhere in the rule book? I&#39;m glad this whole community is here to clarify things, but it&#39;s a shame the rulebook is so lacking in specifications for many situations. I&#39;m sure that when the &quot;Cards&quot; section of the website is updated, things will be clearer, but for now we are just kind of randomly deciding things at home, hahaha.\n",
